        "text": "$$\\int (6 - x - x^2) dx = 6x - \\frac{x^2}{2} - \\frac{x^3}{3}$$\\n\\nEvaluate from $-3$ to $2$:\\n$$\\left[6x - \\frac{x^2}{2} - \\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_{-3}^{2}$$",
