        "text": "At $x = 2$: $12 - 2 - \\frac{8}{3} = 10 - \\frac{8}{3} = \\frac{22}{3}$\\n\\nAt $x = -3$: $-18 - \\frac{9}{2} + 9 = -9 - \\frac{9}{2} = -\\frac{27}{2}$\\n\\nArea = $\\frac{22}{3} - (-\\frac{27}{2}) = \\frac{22}{3} + \\frac{27}{2} = \\frac{44 + 81}{6} = \\frac{125}{6} \\approx 20.83$",
